                "is not",
                "isn't / it's not",
                "It isn't cold. (Não está frio.)"
              ],
              [
                "We",
                "are not",
                "aren't / we're not",
                "We aren't ready. (Nós não estamos prontos.)"
              ],
              [
                "They",
                "are not",
                "aren't / they're not",
                "They aren't Brazilian. (Eles não são brasileiros.)"
